    "Direct and format-1 type-9 extension subtables share one bounded effective type/offset reader in admission, glyph eligibility and pair execution. Outer filters and lookup order remain separate; 32-bit offsets, uniform inner type and nonrecursive payloads are validated.",
    "First matched zero pair adjustments still stop subtable search; selected lookups accumulate once in LookupList order. Mark/context positioning exclusions remain. No new index array, storage owner, cache or public API is introduced.",
